#: ../../source/api_reference.rst:165
msgid "``rules`` (``github.com/kevung/nicomaque/rules``)"
msgstr "``rules`` (``github.com/kevung/nicomaque/rules``)"

#: ../../source/api_reference.rst:166
msgid ""
"Règles en fonctions pures, sans état, sans E/S ni horloge, sur ses "
"propres types (``Ref``, ``Phase``, ``PhaseRules``, ``Seed``, ``Pairing``,"
" ``Section``, ``Node``, ``Src``, ``Slot``, ``Match``, ``Label``, "
"``Note``, ``Standing``, ``Placement``, ``PrizeScale``, ``Retention``, "
"``Interval``, ``Pace``, ``Remaining``, ``Sheet``, ``LengthPlan``…). "
"Appariements : ``Pair``, ``PairSwissRound``, ``PairSwissOrphans``, "
"``PairSwissFallback`` ; graphes : ``BracketSection(s)``, "
"``ConsolationSection``, ``LastChanceSection``, ``GSLSection``, "
"``GSLBlockSections``, ``SESection``, ``PoolSection(s)``, "
"``BarrageSection``, ``Resolve``, ``Ready``, ``ReadyFree``, ``AllDone``, "
"``PhaseDone`` ; tirages : ``DrawSlots``, ``SeedOrder``, ``Partition`` ; "
"classement : ``Rank``, ``RankSection``, ``MergeRankings``, "
"``PoolQualified``, ``PoolTie``, ``PoolWins`` ; dotation : ``Pool``, "
"``Distributable``, ``PlaceAmounts``, ``SharePrizes`` ; prévision et "
"horloge : ``RemainingMatches``, ``PaceAt``, ``ExpectedDuration``, "
"``IsSlow``, ``PlayingTime``, ``DayOfPlay``, ``EstimatedEnd``, "
"``AfterBreaks``, ``WinProbability``, ``MeanRating``, "
"``RemainingDuration`` ; feuille d'appariements : ``Batches``, "
"``PairingSheet``."
msgstr ""
"Rules as pure, stateless functions, with no I/O or clock, on its own "
"types (``Ref``, ``Phase``, ``PhaseRules``, ``Seed``, ``Pairing``, "
"``Section``, ``Node``, ``Src``, ``Slot``, ``Match``, ``Label``, ``Note``,"
" ``Standing``, ``Placement``, ``PrizeScale``, ``Retention``, "
"``Interval``, ``Pace``, ``Remaining``, ``Sheet``, ``LengthPlan``…). "
"Pairings: ``Pair``, ``PairSwissRound``, ``PairSwissOrphans``, "
"``PairSwissFallback``; graphs: ``BracketSection(s)``, "
"``ConsolationSection``, ``LastChanceSection``, ``GSLSection``, "
"``GSLBlockSections``, ``SESection``, ``PoolSection(s)``, "
"``BarrageSection``, ``Resolve``, ``Ready``, ``ReadyFree``, ``AllDone``, "
"``PhaseDone``; draws: ``DrawSlots``, ``SeedOrder``, ``Partition``; "
"standings: ``Rank``, ``RankSection``, ``MergeRankings``, "
"``PoolQualified``, ``PoolTie``, ``PoolWins``; prize distribution: "
"``Pool``, ``Distributable``, ``PlaceAmounts``, ``SharePrizes``; "
"forecasting and clock: ``RemainingMatches``, ``PaceAt``, "
"``ExpectedDuration``, ``IsSlow``, ``PlayingTime``, ``DayOfPlay``, "
"``EstimatedEnd``, ``AfterBreaks``, ``WinProbability``, ``MeanRating``, "
"``RemainingDuration``; pairing sheet: ``Batches``, ``PairingSheet``."

